<title>USA: Grey Advertising Q1 diluted shr $3.58.</title>
<headline>Grey Advertising Q1 diluted shr $3.58.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			For the Three Months Ended March 31(a)</p>
<p>							 1966 Absent</p>
<p>							Non-Recurring</p>
<p>			   1997	  1996	 Income(4)</p>
<p>Gross billings(b)$1,258,949  $1,157,092    $1,157,092</p>
<p>Commissions</p>
<p> and fees	     188,748     173,477	 173,477</p>
<p>Income of</p>
<p>consolidated</p>
<p>companies before</p>
<p> taxes on income	9,582	13,870	   9,846</p>
