<p>Equity in  nonconsolidated</p>
<p> affiliated companies  625	    768	     768</p>
<p>Net income	     4,575	  6,263	   4,143</p>
<p>Net income per</p>
<p>common share (c)</p>
<p> -Primary		 3.69	   4.68	    3.13</p>
<p> -Fully Diluted	 3.58	   4.51	    3.03</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>number of common</p>
